# Form Component Patterns

## Glass Morphism Styling

- Base background: `Color.black.opacity(0.3)`
- Hover background: `Color.white.opacity(0.05)`
- Border: `Color.white.opacity(0.1)`
- Hover border: `Color.accentColor.opacity(0.6)`
- Animation: `.easeInOut(duration: 0.2)`

## Form Field Components

- Use `FormTextField`, `FormNumberField`, `FormDropdown` for consistent styling
- Implement proper validation with error display
- Use `FormDatePicker` for date/time selection
- Apply consistent spacing and padding

## Dropdown Patterns

- Use specialized dropdown components for different data types:
  - `EntityDropdown<T: NSManagedObject>` for Core Data entities
  - `EnumDropdown<T: CaseIterable & Hashable & RawRepresentable>` for enums
  - `OptionalEnumDropdown<T>` for optional enum selection
  - `OptionDropdown` for string options
  - `NonOptionalOptionDropdown` for required string selection

## Validation Integration

- Implement real-time validation with error handling
- Use `SessionFormModel.validateForm()` for comprehensive validation
- Display validation errors inline with form fields
- Prevent form submission with validation errors

## Address Field Handling

- Use `AddressSearchField` component for address input
- Implement proper geocoding without temporary entities
- Use direct `CLGeocoder` calls for coordinate lookup
- Handle address component binding correctly

## Styling Consistency

- Apply glass morphism backgrounds consistently
- Use proper border radius and shadow effects
- Implement hover states for all interactive elements
- Maintain consistent spacing and typography
